# E2E test plan

## Scope

E2E tests verify the **complete** system against real dependencies
(or a staging environment faithful to prod). We distinguish:

- **Golden paths**: the main user journeys that must
  pass on every release. Exhaustive coverage required.
- **Edge cases**: less frequent but high-value scenarios
  (errors, permissions, boundary states). Selective coverage.

Anything that can be validated in local integration (see
[integration-tests.md](./integration-tests.md)) **must** be —
E2E tests are expensive, we reserve them for journeys that cannot
be validated otherwise.

